[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0010","text":"……呼——\n终于……到终点了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0020","text":"虽说节分游行是走路……！\n但全是坡道，还挺累人的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0030","text":"是啊……\n——就快到了呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0040","text":"——大家，当天\n不只是全力炒热气氛，我们自己也要好好享受哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0050","text":"这样的话，\n一定会成为留在大家心中的活动"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0060","text":"……嗯，说得对\n我们也全力享受吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0070","text":"……那个，我有件事想跟大家说"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0080","text":"树里……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0090","text":"之前我说过的吧，『下次再说』\n……就是那件事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0100","text":"我以前啊，该成为什么样的偶像……\n想成为什么样的偶像"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0110","text":"一直都不明白\n——但是现在呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0120","text":"就算支持我的人在很远的地方，\n也能一眼认出是我——那种"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0130","text":"我想成为那样的偶像……\n——我是这么想的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0140","text":"就、就这些……！\n想着还是跟大家说一声"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0150","text":"……恭喜你，树里\n你找到了很棒的目标，我也很开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0160","text":"是的……\n凛世也是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0170","text":"嘿嘿……\n我们一起朝着顶点努力吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0180","text":"……嗯\n谢谢，果穗，还有大家"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0190","text":"……啊——那，我们原路返回吧！\n当然是一边慢跑一边！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_06_0200","text":"好！／嗯！／好的……／好！"}]
